{"speciesId":761,"names":{"fr":"Croquine","es":"Bounsweet","en":"Bounsweet","ja":"アマカジ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Une odeur terriblement appétissante émane du corps des Croquine. Alléchés, les Bazoucan rappliquent et les gobent goulument."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Atraídos por el apetitoso aroma que desprende su cuerpo, los Toucannon los engullen con avidez sin ni siquiera masticar."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"A delectable aroma pours from its body. They are often swallowed whole by Toucannon lured by that wafting deliciousness."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"美味しそうな 香りが 体から 漏れ出している。 匂いに 誘われた ドデカバシに 丸呑みに される。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Trop sucrée pour être consommée telle quelle, la sueur de Croquine doit être diluée dans l’eau pour obtenir un jus sucré juste comme il faut."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La gente lo nota demasiado dulce como para comerlo, pero al diluir el sudor que exhala se obtiene un zumo con el toque justo de dulzura."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Although it’s too sugary for human consumption, Bounsweet’s sweat can be watered down into a juice with just the right amount of sweetness."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"人が 食べるには 甘すぎるが アマカジの汗を 水と 割ると ほどよい 甘さの ジュースになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son odeur appétissante en fait la cible idéale des Pokémon oiseaux, mais comme il n’est pas très malin, ça lui est égal."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El dulce aroma que desprenden los convierte en presa de los Pokémon pájaro, pero, al no ser muy avispados, no se alteran en absoluto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Because of its sweet, delicious aroma, bird Pokémon are always after it, but it’s not intelligent enough to care."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"甘く 美味しそうな 匂いのせいで とりポケモンに 狙われるが あまり 賢くないので 気に していない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pour résister aux Pokémon oiseaux qui tentent de le manger, il fait tourner le sépale qui est sur sa tête, mais c’est généralement peine perdue."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cuando un Pokémon pájaro está a punto de engullirlo, gira el cáliz de su cabeza a modo de hélice para evitarlo, pero suele ser en vano."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It tries to resist being swallowed by a bird Pokémon by spinning the sepals on its head. It’s usually a fruitless attempt."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"とりポケモンに 呑み込まれそうに なると 頭のヘタを 回転して 抵抗するが 大抵 ダメだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"La douce odeur fruitée qui émane de son corps stimule énormément l’appétit des Pokémon oiseaux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"El dulce y afrutado aroma que desprende estimula sobremanera el apetito de los Pokémon pájaro."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its body gives off a sweet, fruity scent that is extremely appetizing to bird Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体から 漏れ出す 果実の 甘い においが 鳥ポケモンの 食欲を 激しく 刺激する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La sueur sucrée qu’il produit lorsqu’on l’attaque est délicieuse. L’odeur de celle-ci lui attire encore plus d’ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando lo atacan, produce un sudor dulce y delicioso cuyo aroma atrae a más enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"When under attack, it secretes a sweet and delicious sweat. The scent only calls more enemies to it."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"襲われた ときに 流す 汗は 甘くて 美味しい。 その 香りが さらに 敵を 増やしてしまうのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":761,"moves":[{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"razor-leaf","learns":[[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{